      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Origin:</strong> Cosmopolitan</li><li><strong>Growth rate:</strong> Medium</li><li><strong>Height:</strong> 10-15+ cm (average height after two months in the tank)</li><li><strong>Light demand:</strong> Low</li><li><strong>CO2:</strong> Low</li></ul>"
